<item><title>MSF reduces staff in Bunyakiri amid clashes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/msf-reduces-staff-in-bunyakiri-amid-clashes-6eaee7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cd/msf-reduces-staff-in-bunyakiri-amid-clashes-6eaee7/</guid><category>DR Congo</category><description>Médecins Sans Frontières has temporarily reduced its personnel in Bunyakiri health zone, South Kivu, due to armed confrontations.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:09:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" length="34755" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
